OL,3,GNEWSAKetamine and cocaine worth
OL,4,A#300,000 seized in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been charged after
OL,7,Fketamine and cocaine worth more than
OL,8,F#300,000 was recovered from a car in
OL,9,FAberdeen.
OL,11,FThe recovery was made in a car park in
OL,12,FGreat Southern Road on Tuesday evening.
OL,14,FThe ketamine had an estimated street
OL,15,Fvalue of #186,000 and the cocaine was
OL,16,Fvalued at #115,000.
OL,18,FTwo women, aged 26 and 28, and two men,
OL,19,Faged 27 and 28, were arrested and
OL,20,Fcharged. They are due to appear at
OL,21,FAberdeen Sheriff Court.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
